Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Turn Smart App Control off. It blocks every binary built on this machine
; (forgejo-mcp included) and has no per-app exception. Off for every app, and
; on many builds it cannot be turned back on without a reinstall.
; Takes effect after a restart. See os/windows/CAVEATS.md.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\CI\Policy]
"VerifiedAndReputablePolicyState"=dword:00000000
